<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93428" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σᾰτῠρ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>suiting a Satyr, like a Satyr</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σωκράτης . . ς. καὶ ὑβριστὴς
					φαινόμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cat.Ma.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				221e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφήμεροι καὶ ς. τοῖς βίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Galb.</u>
					16
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Per.</u>
				13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>of</i> or <i>resembling the Satyric drama</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				222d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποίησις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Po.</u>
					1449a22
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρχησις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					7.72
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρᾶμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					9.6
				</span></i>
			, etc.: abs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σατυρικόν, τό</span>, <i>Satyric drama</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				4.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Po.</u>
				1449a20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.2320.16
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σατυρική</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Tz.
					<u>Proll.Com.</u>
					p.21
				</span></i>
			 K., cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σάτυρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			.</div>
